't need to answer to any other group really. &quot;Just following orders&quot; could be enough reason for them to do all kinds of horrible or unethical things. I look at them as a really grey hunting group that you would rather stay out of their way than to ever involve yourself with. In that sense. This is why i much prefer the Vanguard over them.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>You just, like, named my three favorite groups. Do NOT listen to this man, Hunter 2nd Edition developers!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T09:00:55-07:00","id":482435,"title":"","content":"I didn't care for Ashwood Abbey in the core, but they were pretty good in Compacts and Conspiracies. I hope they stay in the game not because of their value as a protagonist faction, but because they provide such a shocking classist counterpoint to groups like the Union.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T09:30:09-07:00","id":482457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nightout</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/477696-your-least-liked-compacts-conspiracies-and-why?p=482116#post482116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Null Mysteriis</b>: When your in a world full of Vampires, Werewolves, Ghosts and Fairy folk. Disbelief just seem silly. Granted there whole stick is about Scientific methods proving everything they believe is right and disregarding everything else. Feels too condescending to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>They don't disbelieve, they try to analyse and understand.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T09:40:39-07:00","id":482470,"title":"","content":"NM really needed a sidebar making that absolutely explicit in the corebook.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/477696-your-least-liked-compacts-conspiracies-and-why?p=481920#post481920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The one conspiracy I've just never been able to do anything with, to the point that I frequently forget they exist, is the Ascending Ones. Their aesthetic isn't particularly compelling or memorable, and their hodge-podge of influences kind of dilutes whatever theme it was they were looking for.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're not really a hodge-podge. They're an alliance of three entirely different groups.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T13:30:14-07:00","id":482726,"title":"","content":"I've already said which is my least-favourite group, but I want to mention that I also love the Ashwood Abbey. They're honestly one of my favourites. They hunt not because they <i>have</i> to - wealth and privilege frankly probably inure them to most supernatural ills - but because they <i>want</i> to, and there is something so wonderfully intriguing about that. Most other Hunters have some extrinsic motivation; they want to protect their family/neighbourhood, they believe their mission is divinely ordained, they subscribe to some noble philosophy, they were born with tainted blood, etc., but the Abbey <i>chooses</i> to hunt. They see this world full of vicious nightmares that they never actually have to be a part of if they don't want to and choose to throw themselves at it with wide smiles. They're the wild game hunters of the modern day; the mad wanderers who ran to the unexplored (by Europeans, at least) corners of the Earth, throwing caution to the wind and risking everything for the sake of adventure. They are so jaded by living in a world where their status is largely assured that they have to risk everything on hedonistic pleasure-seeking.<br /> <br /> When I think of the Ashwood Abbey, it's just as easy to picture an old man with a mustache that probably has its own seat at the UN lounging in a room full of rifles and big game trophies as it is the young trust-fund tommies smashing mailboxes with baseball bats out the window of a convertible. Honestly, the former probably comes more easily than the latter, because the quick-to-the-trigger kiddies probably don't last as long as those who have more respect for their sport.<br /> <br /> The Ashwood Abbey probably <i>does</i> feel like a slap to the face of most Hunters but that's a part of why they're fun, just as, say, the Lucifuge calling on demonic power probably feels like a slap to many Hunters, or claiming your hunt is divine retribution probably feels like a slap to many Hunters, or profiting off your hunt feels like a slap, etc.<br /> <br /> Not everyone's in the Vigil for the same reasons. Different motivations for the same action can and should be something that makes Hunters look askew at each other. After all, even the most supposedly benevolent Hunter is still a murderous obsessive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T13:46:10-07:00","id":482733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/477696-your-least-liked-compacts-conspiracies-and-why?p=482457#post482457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They don't disbelieve, they try to analyse and understand.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's there approach that seems lack luster to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T13:51:02-07:00","id":482739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dude of Legend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/477696-your-least-liked-compacts-conspiracies-and-why?p=482210#post482210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You just, like, named my three favorite groups. Do NOT listen to this man, Hunter 2nd Edition developers!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Don't mean to step on anyone's toes. Just my opinion. ( But seriously, TFV can be a frightening antagonist group of Hunters) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}